---
/** About page body — massageinaddisababa.com */
---

<article class="about-page pb-12">
  <header class="about-hero mb-10 grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <h1 class="mb-2 font-serif text-[clamp(1.85rem,4.5vw,2.55rem)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white">
        About Massage In Addis Ababa
      </h1>
      <p class="sub mb-5 text-lg text-vip-gold-light">Your trusted directory for verified massage in Ethiopia's capital</p>
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-vip-muted md:text-base">
        <p>
          Massage In Addis Ababa connects clients with independent massage providers across the city. We focus on clear
          profiles, direct contact, and discreet booking—whether you prefer incall at a private location or outcall to
          your hotel or residence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-figure m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-vip border border-vip-line shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)]">
      <img
        src="/images/about/hero.jpg"
        alt="Relaxing massage environment in Addis Ababa"
        width="1200"
        height="675"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>
  </header>

  <section class="about-stats mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Platform highlights">
    <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel px-4 py-5 text-center">
      <strong class="block font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">130+</strong>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-vip-muted">Active listings</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel px-4 py-5 text-center">
      <strong class="block font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">Direct</strong>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-vip-muted">WhatsApp &amp; Telegram booking</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel px-4 py-5 text-center">
      <strong class="block font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">24/7</strong>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-vip-muted">Browse &amp; message anytime</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="section-title mb-2">Why use our directory?</h2>
    <p class="muted mb-5 max-w-2xl text-vip-muted">A simple way to find professional massage in Addis without agency markups.</p>

    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(260px,360px)]">
      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel p-5">
          <h3 class="mt-0 font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">For clients</h3>
          <p class="mb-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vip-muted md:text-base">
            Filter by area, services, and availability. Read full profiles and contact providers directly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel p-5">
          <h3 class="mt-0 font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">For providers</h3>
          <p class="mb-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vip-muted md:text-base">
            Control your photos, rates, hours, and service list. Reach clients who are actively searching in Addis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel p-5 sm:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="mt-0 font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-vip-gold-light">Transparent pricing</h3>
          <p class="mb-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vip-muted md:text-base">
            Rates shown on profiles are set by each provider. Confirm duration, incall/outcall, and any extras before you meet.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-figure m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-vip border border-vip-line lg:sticky lg:top-24">
        <img
          src="/images/about/platform.jpg"
          alt="Massage In Addis Ababa platform — connecting clients and providers"
          width="800"
          height="450"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-vip border border-vip-line bg-vip-panel p-5 md:p-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-10">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <h2 class="section-title mb-4">Safety &amp; discretion</h2>
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-vip-muted">
        <p>
          We operate as a listing directory only. Appointments are private agreements between adults. We encourage:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Clear communication before every session</li>
          <li>Respect for boundaries and listed services</li>
          <li>Reporting suspicious or misleading profiles to our team</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-figure m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-vip border border-vip-line">
      <img
        src="/images/about/trust.jpg"
        alt="Calm, professional massage setting"
        width="800"
        height="1067"
        class="h-full max-h-[420px] w-full object-cover lg:max-h-none"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>
  </section>

  <div class="cta mt-10">
    <a
      class="btn primary inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-vip-gold bg-vip-gold px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[#1b1305] no-underline hover:brightness-110"
      href="/search/"
    >
      Find massage providers
    </a>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .about-page .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 0.65rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-page .section-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  .about-figure {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-hero .about-figure {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      min-height: 280px;
    }
  }
  .about-page .prose ul {
    list-style: disc;
  }
  .about-page .prose li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
